    {
      "text": "↵This is the application we built for the MasterCode hackathon 2015 Hong Kong.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "merchcirlce",
        "title": "MerchCircle",
        "url": "/blog/merchcirlce/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The application was submitted to http://www.hackathon.io/sellspree.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "merchcirlce",
        "title": "MerchCircle",
        "url": "/blog/merchcirlce/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The source code for this project can be found at ↵https://github.com/neoalienson/merchcircle-app (iOS) and ↵https://github.com/neoalienson/merchcircle-web (Web and Backend).",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "merchcirlce",
        "title": "MerchCircle",
        "url": "/blog/merchcirlce/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Web and backend hosts were on Heroku.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "merchcirlce",
        "title": "MerchCircle",
        "url": "/blog/merchcirlce/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": ":::githubCard{user=\"neoalienson\" repo=\"merchcircle-app\"}↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "merchcirlce",
        "title": "MerchCircle",
        "url": "/blog/merchcirlce/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": ":::githubCard{user=\"neoalienson\" repo=\"merchcircle-web\"}↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "merchcirlce",
        "title": "MerchCircle",
        "url": "/blog/merchcirlce/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "MerchCircle is the simplest solution for selling things to your friends.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "merchcirlce",
        "title": "MerchCircle",
        "url": "/blog/merchcirlce/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "By tapping on 'Sell something', you can become a shop owner.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "merchcirlce",
        "title": "MerchCircle",
        "url": "/blog/merchcirlce/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You will be required to use MasterCard credit numbers, as we utilize the MasterCard money transfer API to receive money upon transaction completion.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "merchcirlce",
        "title": "MerchCircle",
        "url": "/blog/merchcirlce/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "After sharing the item link to your friend, your friend can pay you directly through our web frontend,",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "merchcirlce",
        "title": "MerchCircle",
        "url": "/blog/merchcirlce/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cha-ching!↵",
      "sourceRef": {
